q.enqueue(2)
q.enqueue(3)

print(q.dequeue())  # prints 1
print(q.peek())     # prints 2
print(q.size())     # prints 2
print(q.is_empty()) # prints False

q.dequeue()
q.dequeue()
print(q.is_empty()) # prints True
```<|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>

